ified-1 — held-out doc test test_bridge_vocabulary_stale_heldout flagged deprecated spellings (bridge-fsck/bridge-probe/jira-onboard) in docs/architecture.md (banned outside allowlist; ADR path is history-exempt). Fix: reworded architecture.md generically, deferring the alias taxonomy to ADR 0100; verified held-out test + cli-reference --check green locally. Amended (same Change-Id), pushed PS2. Awaiting re-run.","timestamp":1787175633480907001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 educative-hygienic-dore CLOSED. Change 1917 MERGED (LLM-Review+1 via rerun-llm-review self-service after ~11min bot latency; Verified+1). Completion gate required: (1) all 5 AC boxes ticked in description, (2) operator-attested provenance line with valid enums (privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call) IN the description not just a comment, (3) reconciling ADR number 0099->0100 across the whole description (0099 taken by binding-store ADR). Also fixed epic 09ae AC line 0099->0100. Worktree reset to origin/main 9bfe4b428a (S1 mirror-replicated). Next: S2a b2ff (cascades claim to S2 2635).","timestamp":1787178840461911001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2a (tremendous-comely-blesbok) landed to review as Gerrit change 1925. Held-out oracle GREEN (38 tests), mutation teeth confirmed. Reverted subagent pyproject BLE001 carve-out; fixed immutability test to pytest.raises. ENV NOTE: pre-commit make lint/typecheck need venv on PATH (env PATH prefix) else ambient ruff 0.15.6 + missing mypy give phantom failures. CONTRACT NOTE: committing a new src file makes it git-tracked -> retired-token source scan catches it; removed concrete Route('purge-bridge', retired=True), retired mechanism stays on synthetic routes. Rebased onto origin/main 6a4fd2fbb0. Awaiting LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1.","timestamp":1787181986302886001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"RP-05 S2a PS4: root-caused CI flake (run A ubuntu/macos FAIL vs run B PASS on same PS3 commit). NOT pre-existing on origin/main — introduced by my own test. test_cli_registry.py::test_construction_imports_no_command_handlers did sys.modules.pop('pydantic_ai', 'rebar_reconciler', ...) WITHOUT restoring, poisoning the shared xdist worker: later test_pai_output/test_llm_failure_classifier hit 'module pydantic_ai has no attribute models', and test_doctor_dirty_tree hit split-module-identity empty-reads/RepairPauseError. Fix: rewrote the import-isolation check to run in a FRESH subprocess (mirrors test_audit_serve_heldout pattern) so it never mutates this interpreter's sys.modules. Also narrowed forbidden set to the honest S2a guarantee (pydantic_ai/rebar_reconciler/_bridge_commands/_commands.* stay OUT); dropped _llm_commands/_workflow_commands which the pre-cutover eager parent __init__ legitimately imports (S6 cutover territory). Verified: victims+registry 79 passed one-interpreter; teeth = injecting 'import pydantic_ai' into _registry drives RED; lint/typecheck clean. Amended, pushed PS4 (stale LLM/Verified votes correctly retired on content change).","timestamp":1787187827330174001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2a (tremendous-comely-blesbok / b2ff) CLOSED. All 5 AC boxes checked (codebase-verified by merged tests in change 1925 -> commit 087c5b2796). Completion-verifier close gate PASSED. Unblocked S2b (eb0d) and S2c (a8ce).","timestamp":1787196057492333001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2c (groundable-expectable-grackle / a8ce) plan-review PASS after remediating 3 blocking findings (readiness proving check for AC5; ParseError-vs-SystemExit seam reconciliation for _bridge_commands+trusted_env_cmd; additive usage/add_help/formatter_class passthroughs on S2a _parser.py to preserve bespoke presentation). Added _parser.py to file_impact; folded help/usage byte-parity into AC4 (advisory). CLAIMED, starting held-out TDD.","timestamp":1787197074346512001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2c RED evidence captured. Happy-path oracle tests/unit/test_advanced_cli_parsers.py: 5 RED (missing _parser presentation passthroughs; missing rebar._cli._parsers.advanced package + factories), 1 green guard (defaults-unchanged). Held-out edge/E2E oracle (byte-exact --help parity, ParseError->exit-2 seam, alias option-surface sharing, full registry factory readiness) + pre-migration golden JSON saved to session heldout-s2c/, kept OUT of implementer tree. Dispatching implementation subagent.","timestamp":1787197485773530001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2c implementation validated against held-out oracle: 26 tests GREEN (20 held-out interface + 6 happy-path unit) after fixing one held-out edge catch (remote-cert --help width drift: factory used RebarHelpFormatter w80 vs original argparse.HelpFormatter w78 -> byte drift; fixed by passing formatter_class=argparse.HelpFormatter). Byte-exact help parity, ParseError->exit-2 seam, alias option-surface sharing (bridge setup==jira-onboard), and full registry factory-reference readiness all proven. Held-out oracle removed from tree (kept in session heldout-s2c/). REMAINING: AC1 gap - audit/metrics/enrich/identity kept duplicate grammar (census factory + manual runtime walk); dispatched implementer to route accepted-argv dispatch through the factory (behavior-preserving) to eliminate duplication.","timestamp":1787206843968145001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2c pushed as Gerrit change 1953 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/1953). Commit rebased clean onto current origin/main (a540504c92). Change-Id Ic32ed6a, rebar-ticket trailer + DCO sign-off present. Pre-push validation: held-out oracle 26 GREEN (teeth confirmed: render_parse_error->0 mutation reddens 8 malformed asserts; remote-cert formatter catch), broad regression 223+238 GREEN, lint+typecheck clean, re-validated 80 GREEN post-rebase. RESIDUAL (Phase-5): the 4 de-duplicated manual families (audit/metrics/enrich/identity) now emit argparse-standard reject TEXT for structural errors instead of bespoke strings (exit codes preserved; no test pins old text) - AC1<->AC4 tension resolved toward AC1 single-grammar; ACCEPTED as consistency improvement. Awaiting LLM-Review + Verified gates.","timestamp":1787208680083724001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2c change 1953: CI Verified failed on patchset 1 via repo-wide contract test_bridge_vocabulary_stale_heldout (new parser files bridge_arms.py + jira.py named legacy hyphenated aliases bridge-fsck/bridge-probe/jira-onboard). Fix (non-behavioral, matches precedent of _jira_onboard.py/bridge_fsck.py already in the set): added both compat parser files to _COMPATIBILITY_FILES; corrected jira.py docstring mislabel (bridge setup is primary, jira-onboard the retained alias). Contract 7/7 green, lint+typecheck+oracle green. Amended (Change-Id preserved), rebased clean onto origin/main 54469ca, pushed patchset 2. 2 local facade failures are environmental only (git safe.bareRepository=explicit on bare-repo helper), not code. LLM-Review+1 auto-removed on the new patchset (correct re-review-on-update behavior).","timestamp":1787210157089312001}],"created_at":1787174561124017001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"e4283698-0fd0-4f87-8717-f029f91bd591","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"b2ff-03f7-a223-4900"},{"link_uuid":"0eaaaf87-8470-47a5-960e-807ba7ea7767","relation":"rela